<blockquote>
Eulogy for Clevedore

Clevedore as brave as any of us -

going back home. 
<br>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
It was too quiet here for her, 

she said she had to go back and make things right -

she wanted another chance. 
<br>
</blockquote>
<blockquote>
They didn't give her that chance. 
<br>
</blockquote><blockquote>
With heavy heart, 

Let us remember her smiles, 

her ears, her tattoos.
<br> 
</blockquote><blockquote>
Polish her great gun, just as she once did,

and think of what it is to be a fallen god. 

exiled in icy Verduba.
<br> 
</blockquote><blockquote>
Karos. Former Captain of the Epilomelos. 3031.</blockquote>
